0.1.1:
  Add token re-login recovery when coordinator update fails.
  Bump omnilogic library dependency to 0.4.9.
  Move set_pump_speed action registration to dedicated services module.
  Migrate sensors to UnitOfRatio enums with backward-compatible fallback.
  Add ConfigEntryError handling for setup login failures.
  Add single_config_entry manifest flag and update icons.json schema.
  Add scripts/install helper script.
0.1.0:
  Initial custom release.
  Add heater active state binary sensor (heaterState).
  Add instant salt level sensor (instantSaltLevel).
  Add negative/wrap-around temperature sensor fix.
  Retain user-configurable polling interval in options flow.
  Add HACS compatibility and upstream sync tooling.
